Template: hookdeployed/enroll_token
Type: string
Default:
Description: One-time HookDeploy enrollment token:
 The hookdeployed service needs credentials before it can start.
 Leave this empty to install only; enroll later in a real terminal:
 .
  sudo -u hookdeployed env HOOKDEPLOY_CERT_DIR=/var/lib/hookdeployed/certs \
    /usr/bin/hookdeployed enroll
  sudo systemctl enable --now hookdeployed
 .
 A token from the dashboard (hd_enroll_…) enrolls and starts the
 service unattended. The token is one-time and is not stored.
